          <a href="#shovel-types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Pusher, Scoop or Combo</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 7 Picks</a>
          <a href="#blade-width" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Blade Width vs Snow Weight</a>
