          <a href="#technique" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Shoveling Without Hurting Your Back</a>
          <a href="#wheeled" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Do Wheeled Shovels Work?</a>
